<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    >

    <title>Página não encontrada</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at top left,
                    rgba(255, 126, 95, 0.25),
                    transparent 35%
                ),
                radial-gradient(
                    circle at bottom right,
                    rgba(91, 20, 95, 0.35),
                    transparent 40%
                ),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #160c1d, #32153a, #5b145f);

            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            min-height: 520px;

            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 50px;

            padding: 50px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            border-radius: 30px;

            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            box-shadow:
                0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding: 8px 14px;

            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
            border-radius: 999px;

            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .content h1 {
            font-size: 88px;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 8px;

            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                #ffffff,
                #ffb199,
                #ff7e5f
            );

            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }

        .content h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .content p {
            max-width: 430px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;

            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;

            min-height: 48px;
            padding: 0 22px;

            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.25s ease;
        }

        .button-primary {
            color: #32153a;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .button-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
        }

        .button-secondary {
            color: #ffffff;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
        }

        .button-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }

        .illustration {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 350px;
        }

        .plate {
            position: relative;
            width: 290px;
            height: 290px;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            border-radius: 50%;
            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    145deg,
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
                    rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)
                );

            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);

            box-shadow:
                0 35px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28),
                inset 0 0 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);

            animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .plate::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 220px;
            height: 220px;

            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);

            animation: rotate 18s linear infinite;
        }

        .food-icon {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            font-size: 115px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 18px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3));
        }

        .mini-icon {
            position: absolute;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            width: 58px;
            height: 58px;

            border-radius: 18px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);

            font-size: 26px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .icon-one {
            top: 10px;
            right: 5px;
            animation: float 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .icon-two {
            bottom: 15px;
            left: 5px;
            animation: float 4.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .icon-three {
            top: 60px;
            left: -20px;
            animation: float 3.8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .shadow {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 8px;

            width: 230px;
            height: 34px;

            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
            filter: blur(14px);
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            50% {
                transform: translateY(-14px);
            }
        }

        @keyframes rotate {
            from {
                transform: rotate(0deg);
            }

            to {
                transform: rotate(360deg);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 780px) {
            .container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 38px 24px;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .content {
                order: 2;
            }

            .illustration {
                order: 1;
                min-height: 260px;
            }

            .plate {
                width: 220px;
                height: 220px;
            }

            .plate::before {
                width: 165px;
                height: 165px;
            }

            .food-icon {
                font-size: 85px;
            }

            .content h1 {
                font-size: 70px;
            }

            .content h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .content p {
                margin-left: auto;
                margin-right: auto;
            }

            .buttons {
                justify-content: center;
            }

            .mini-icon {
                width: 48px;
                height: 48px;
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 430px) {
            body {
                padding: 14px;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 30px 18px;
                border-radius: 22px;
            }

            .content h1 {
                font-size: 58px;
            }

            .content h2 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }

            .button {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="container">
        <section class="content">
            <span class="tag">Erro de navegação</span>

            <h1>404</h1>

            <h2>Ops! Essa página saiu do cardápio.</h2>

            <p>
                A página que você está procurando não existe, foi removida
                ou o endereço informado está incorreto.
            </p>

            <div class="buttons">
                <a href="/" class="button button-primary">
                    Voltar ao início
                </a>

                <a
                    href="javascript:history.back()"
                    class="button button-secondary"
                >
                    Página anterior
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="illustration">
            <div class="shadow"></div>

            <div class="plate">
                <span class="food-icon">🍔</span>

                <span class="mini-icon icon-one">🍕</span>
                <span class="mini-icon icon-two">🍟</span>
                <span class="mini-icon icon-three">🥤</span>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>